        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ad7895/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-07-06T11:22:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jorgenp\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/958977/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> jorgenp:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I haven't gone about unlocking it.&nbsp; I may or may not have finished the first condition, but I definitely haven't done the second.&nbsp; Is there any part of it that we think still needs to be tested?&nbsp; I'm willing to act as a guinea-pig if there is something we are missing.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Well, the current method we've got definitely seems to work for everyone, so if what we've got still isn't quite right, then you'd think we must be making it more complicated that it really has to be, somehow?</p>",
