      {
        "id": 175808,
        "name": "sillyellie",
        "username": "sillyellie",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/e9a140/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-08-07T03:40:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just unlocked.</p><p>Thoughts:</p><p>Game 1. Defeat Omnitron with Omnitron-X and Unity. (Possibly with both Omnitron-X and Unity not incapped)</p><p>Game 2. Defeat Cosmic Omnitron with Omnitron-X and Unity. Omnitron-X must be incapped. (Possibly Unity not incapped)</p><p>Game 3. Defeat any villian with Unity and without any variant of Tachyon or Omnitron-X on the team. Construction Pylon, Modular Workbench, Scrap Metal, Supply Crate, and Volatile Parts must be in play. Robot Reclamation must be played at least once.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I never played Slip Through Time or Self-Sacrifice. I never brought Tachyon. Visionary was incapped every game, no one else was besides Omnitron-X second game. No decks were ever completely gone through though I didn't pay attention to what all was played by Omnitron. First two games were played in Insula Primalis, third game was against Baron Blade in Silver Gulch.&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 132,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:59:27.017Z",
